    "number": 11,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p004",
    "quote": "自召公已下九世至惠侯。燕惠侯當周厲王奔彘，共和之時。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0900-0801/bce-0826.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-005",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p005",
    "quote": "惠侯卒，子釐侯立。是歲，周宣王初即位。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0900-0801/bce-0806.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-006",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p005",
    "quote": "釐侯二十一年，鄭桓公初封於鄭。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
