    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-047",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p015",
    "quote": "孝公十二年，韓、魏、趙滅知伯，分其地，三晉彊。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0450.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-048",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p016",
    "quote": "十五年，孝公卒，成公立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0434.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-049",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p016",
    "quote": "成公十六年卒，湣公立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0403.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-050",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p016",
    "quote": "湣公三十一年卒，釐公立。是歲，三晉列為諸侯。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0373.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-051",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p017",
    "quote": "釐公三十年，伐敗齊于林營。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0373.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-052",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p017",
    "quote": "釐公卒，桓公立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0362.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-8",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-053",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p017",
    "quote": "桓公十一年卒，文公立。是歲，秦獻公卒。秦益彊。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0334.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj034-suqin-early-chain",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-054",
    "number": null,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p018",
    "quote": "文公十九年，齊威王卒。二十八年，蘇秦始來見，說文公。文公予車馬金帛以至趙，趙肅侯用之。因約六國，為從長。秦惠王以其女為燕太子婦。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0333.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-055",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p019",
    "quote": "二十九年，文公卒，太子立，是為易王。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0332.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj034-return-ten-cities",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-056",
    "number": null,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p020",
    "quote": "易王初立，齊宣王因燕喪伐我，取十城；蘇秦說齊，使復歸燕十城。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0323.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-057",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p020",
    "quote": "十年，燕君為王。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0323.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj034-suqin-liaison",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-058",
    "number": null,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p020",
    "quote": "蘇秦與燕文公夫人私通，懼誅，乃說王使齊為反閒，欲以亂齊。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0321.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-059",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p020",
    "quote": "易王立十二年卒，子燕噲立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0320.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj034-suqin-death",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-060",
    "number": null,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p021",
    "quote": "燕噲既立，齊人殺蘇秦。蘇秦之在燕，與其相子之為婚，而蘇代與子之交。及蘇秦死，而齊宣王復用蘇代。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0318.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-061",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p021",
    "quote": "燕噲三年，與楚、三晉攻秦，不勝而還。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0316.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-062",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p021",
    "quote": "子之相燕，貴重，主斷。蘇代為齊使於燕，燕王問曰：「齊王奚如？」對曰：「必不霸。」燕王曰：「何也？」對曰：「不信其臣。」蘇代欲以激燕王以尊子之也。於是燕王大信子之。子之因遺蘇代百金，而聽其所使。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0316.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-063",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p022",
    "quote": "鹿毛壽謂燕王：「不如以國讓相子之。人之謂堯賢者，以其讓天下於許由，許由不受，有讓天下之名而實不失天下。今王以國讓於子之，子之必不敢受，是王與堯同行也。」燕王因屬國於子之，子之大重。或曰：「禹薦益，已而以啟人為吏。及老，而以啟人為不足任乎天下，傳之於益。已而啟與交黨攻益，奪之。天下謂禹名傳天下於益，已而實令啟自取之。今王言屬國於子之，而吏無非太子人者，是名屬子之而實太子用事也。」王因收印自三百石吏已上而效之子之。子之南面行王事，而噲老不聽政，顧為臣，國事皆決於子之。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0314.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-064",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "太子因要黨聚眾，將軍市被圍公宮，攻子之，不克。將軍市被及百姓反攻太子平，將軍市被死，以徇。因搆難數月，死者數萬，眾人恫恐，百姓離志。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0312.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-5",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-065",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "燕子之亡二年，而燕人共立太子平，是為燕昭王。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0312.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj034-zhaowang-recruit-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-066",
    "number": 6,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p024",
    "quote": "燕昭王於破燕之後即位，卑身厚幣以招賢者。謂郭隗曰：「齊因孤之國亂而襲破燕，孤極知燕小力少，不足以報。然誠得賢士以共國，以雪先王之恥，孤之願也。先生視可者，得身事之。」郭隗曰：「王必欲致士，先從隗始。況賢於隗者，豈遠千里哉！」於是昭王為隗改筑宮而師事之。樂毅自魏往，鄒衍自齊往，劇辛自趙往，士爭趨燕。燕王噲死問孤，與百姓同甘苦。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0284.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-067",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p025",
    "quote": "二十八年，燕國殷富，士卒樂軼輕戰，於是遂以樂毅為上將軍，與秦、楚、三晉合謀以伐齊。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0284.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-068",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p025",
    "quote": "齊兵敗，湣王出亡於外。燕兵獨追北，入至臨淄，盡取齊寶，燒其宮室宗廟。齊城之不下者，獨唯聊、莒、即墨，其餘皆屬燕，六歲。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0279.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-069",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p026",
    "quote": "昭王三十三年卒，子惠王立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0279.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-070",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p027",
    "quote": "惠王爲太子時，與樂毅有隙；及即位，疑毅，使騎劫代將。樂毅亡走趙。齊田單以即墨擊敗燕軍，騎劫死，燕兵引歸，齊悉復得其故城。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0284.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-071",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p027",
    "quote": "湣王死于莒，乃立其子爲襄王。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0283.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-072",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p027",
    "quote": "湣王死于莒，乃立其子爲襄王。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0272.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-073",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p028",
    "quote": "惠王七年卒。韓、魏、楚共伐燕。燕武成王立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0265.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-074",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p029",
    "quote": "武成王七年，齊田單伐我，拔中陽。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0260.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-075",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p029",
    "quote": "十三年，秦敗趙於長平四十餘萬。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0258.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj034-wucheng-death-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-076",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p029",
    "quote": "十四年，武成王卒，子孝王立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0257.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-077",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p030",
    "quote": "孝王元年，秦圍邯鄲者解去。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0255.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj034-xiaowang-death-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-078",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p030",
    "quote": "三年卒，子今王喜立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0251.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-079",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p031",
    "quote": "今王喜四年，秦昭王卒。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0251.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-080",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p031",
    "quote": "今王喜四年，秦昭王卒。燕王命相栗腹約歡趙，以五百金為趙王酒。還報燕王曰：「趙王壯者皆死長平，其孤未壯，可伐也。」王召昌國君樂閒問之。對曰：「趙四戰之國，其民習兵，不可伐。」王曰：「吾以五而伐一。」對曰：「不可。」燕王怒，群臣皆以為可。卒起二軍，車二千乘，栗腹將而攻鄗，卿秦攻代。唯獨大夫將渠謂燕王曰：「與人通關約交，以五百金飲人之王，使者報而反攻之，不祥，兵無成功。」燕王不聽，自將偏軍隨之。將渠引燕王綬止之曰：「王必無自往，往無成功。」王蹵之以足。將渠泣曰：「臣非以自為，為王也！」燕軍至宋子，趙使廉頗將，擊破栗腹於鄗。［樂乘］破卿秦（樂乘）於代。樂閒奔趙。廉頗逐之五百餘里，圍其國。燕人請和，趙人不許，必令將渠處和。燕相將渠以處和。趙聽將渠，解燕圍。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0249.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-081",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p032",
    "quote": "六年，秦滅東（西）周，置三川郡。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0248.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-082",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p032",
    "quote": "七年，秦拔趙榆次三十七城，秦置大原郡。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0247.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-083",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p032",
    "quote": "秦置大原郡。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0247.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-084",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p032",
    "quote": "九年，秦王政初即位。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0245.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-085",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p032",
    "quote": "十年，趙使廉頗將攻繁陽，拔之。趙孝成王卒，悼襄王立。使樂乘代廉頗，廉頗不聽，攻樂乘，樂乘走，廉頗奔大梁。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0244.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-086",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p032",
    "quote": "十二年，趙使李牧攻燕，拔武遂、方城。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0242.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-087",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p032",
    "quote": "劇辛故居趙，與龐煖善，已而亡走燕。燕見趙數困于秦，而廉頗去，令龐煖將也，欲因趙獘攻之。問劇辛，辛曰：「龐煖易與耳。」燕使劇辛將擊趙，趙使龐煖擊之，取燕軍二萬，殺劇辛。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0242.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-088",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p032",
    "quote": "秦拔魏二十城，置東郡。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0236.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-089",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p032",
    "quote": "十九年，秦拔趙之鄴九城。趙悼襄王卒。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0232.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-090",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p032",
    "quote": "二十三年，太子丹質於秦，亡歸燕。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0230.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-091",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p032",
    "quote": "二十五年，秦虜滅韓王安，置潁川郡。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0228.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-092",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p032",
    "quote": "二十七年，秦虜趙王遷，滅趙。趙公子嘉自立為代王。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0227.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-093",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p033",
    "quote": "燕見秦且滅六國，秦兵臨易水，禍且至燕。太子丹陰養壯士二十人，使荊軻獻督亢地圖於秦，因襲刺秦王。秦王覺，殺軻，使將軍王翦擊燕。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0226.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-094",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p033",
    "quote": "二十九年，秦攻拔我薊，燕王亡，徙居遼東，斬丹以獻秦。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0225.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-095",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p033",
    "quote": "三十年，秦滅魏。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0222.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-096",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p034",
    "quote": "三十三年，秦拔遼東，虜燕王喜，卒滅燕。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0222.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-097",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p034",
    "quote": "是歲，秦將王賁亦虜代王嘉。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0222.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj034-taishigong",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-098",
    "number": null,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p035",
    "quote": "太史公曰：召公奭可謂仁矣！笆棠且思之，況其人乎？燕（北）［外］迫蠻貉，內措齊、晉，崎嶇彊國之閒，最為弱小，幾滅者數矣。然社稷血食者八九百歲，於姬姓獨後亡，豈非召公之烈邪！",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0222.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj034-later-commendation",
    "placement_anchor": "sj034-cite-099",
    "number": null,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷034-燕召公世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "z001",
    "quote": "索隱述贊曰：召伯作相，分陝而治。人惠其德，甘棠是思。莊送霸主，惠羅寵姬。文公約趙，蘇秦騁辭。易王初立，齊宣我欺。燕噲無道，禪位子之。昭王待士，思報臨菑。督亢不就，卒見芟夷。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  }
]
